Package: libpoppler-qt6-3
Version: @DEB_POPPLER_QT6_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
Depends: libpoppler140, qt6-base
Description: PDF rendering library - Qt6 interface
 Poppler is a PDF rendering library based on the xpdf code base. This package
 contains the Qt6 shared library used by Qt/KDE PDF viewers such as Okular.
